  m_Name: 18_Jom_diak_maawatan_Teach
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  speakerName: Jom
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'If someone says something you don''t understand, it''s useful to
    let them know.

    In Ilokano, ''diak maawatan'' means ''I don''t understand.''

    You
    can use it when you need someone to explain something again.

    Listen carefully:
    diak maawatan.

    Now, try saying ''diak maawatan'' yourself.'
